CHECK:ALLOC_SIZEOF_STRUCT: Prefer kzalloc(sizeof(*async_out)...) over kzalloc(sizeof(struct mlx5_async_create_mkey)...)
#250: FILE: drivers/infiniband/hw/mlx5/mr.c:244:
+		async_out = kzalloc(sizeof(struct mlx5_async_create_mkey),

The allocation style is bad.  In general for family of
allocation functions using sizeof() to get memory size,
constructs like::

  p = alloc(sizeof(struct foo), ...)

should be::

  p = alloc(sizeof(*p), ...)

See: https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/coding-style.html#allocating-memory

